td.paragraph:
Other materials not provided (see 
                                    Figure A
                                 ):

Only your healthcare providers or caregivers can use the outer area of the upper arm (see 
   Figure G
).

list.item:
Wash your hands thoroughly with soap and water (see 
                                       Figure H
                                    ).

Insert needle at a 45°(degree) to 90° angle (see 
                                       Figure K
                                    ).

While pinching the skin, push the plunger head all the way down using slow and constant pressure (see 
                                       Figure L
                                    ).

Do not throw away (dispose of) loose needles and syringes in your household trash (see 
   Figure N
).
